    {
      "id": "node-code-build-prompt",
      "name": "Code \u2014 Build Brief Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [850, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Get data from all sources via the Merge node\nconst items = $input.all();\n\n// Separate data by source — identify by checking fields\nconst ventasRows = items.filter(i => i.json.Pedidos !== undefined || i.json.Ingresos !== undefined);\nconst marketingRows = items.filter(i => i.json.Visitas !== undefined || i.json.ROAS !== undefined);\nconst soporteRows = items.filter(i => i.json.Tickets !== undefined || i.json.Satisfaccion !== undefined);\nconst rssItems = items.filter(i => i.json.title && i.json.link);\n\n// Last row of each sheet = yesterday's data\nconst ventas = ventasRows[ventasRows.length - 1]?.json || {};\nconst marketing = marketingRows[marketingRows.length - 1]?.json || {};\nconst soporte = soporteRows[soporteRows.length - 1]?.json || {};\n\n// Top 5 RSS articles\nconst noticias = rssItems.slice(0, 5).map(i => `- ${i.json.title}`).join('\\n');\n\nconst prompt = `Sos un analista de negocio senior. Tu trabajo es leer los datos de ayer de una tienda e-commerce llamada NovaTrend y generar un brief ejecutivo conciso.\n\nDATOS DE VENTAS:\n- Pedidos: ${ventas.Pedidos || 'N/A'}\n- Ingresos: $${ventas.Ingresos || 'N/A'}\n- Ticket promedio: $${ventas.Ticket_Promedio || 'N/A'}\n- Devoluciones: ${ventas.Devoluciones || 'N/A'}\n- Margen bruto: ${ventas.Margen_Bruto || 'N/A'}%\n\nDATOS DE MARKETING:\n- Visitas: ${marketing.Visitas || 'N/A'}\n- Tasa de conversion: ${marketing.Conversion || 'N/A'}%\n- ROAS: ${marketing.ROAS || 'N/A'}\n- Emails enviados: ${marketing.Emails_Enviados || 'N/A'}\n- Tasa de apertura: ${marketing.Tasa_Apertura || 'N/A'}%\n\nDATOS DE SOPORTE:\n- Tickets abiertos: ${soporte.Tickets || 'N/A'}\n- Tiempo de respuesta promedio: ${soporte.Tiempo_Respuesta || 'N/A'} min\n- Satisfaccion: ${soporte.Satisfaccion || 'N/A'}/5\n- Tickets escalados: ${soporte.Escalados || 'N/A'}\n\nNOTICIAS DE IA RECIENTES:\n${noticias || 'No se encontraron noticias'}\n\nGenera un brief ejecutivo con estas secciones:\n1. RESUMEN (2-3 oraciones del estado general)\n2. ALERTAS (metricas que estan fuera de rango o necesitan atencion)\n3. OPORTUNIDADES (cosas positivas o tendencias para aprovechar)\n4. NOTICIAS RELEVANTES (si alguna noticia de IA impacta al negocio, mencionarla)\n\nFormato: claro, directo, con emojis para scanability. Maximo 300 palabras.`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { prompt } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-openai-request",
      "name": "OpenAI \u2014 Generate Brief",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer YOUR_OPENAI_API_KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "body": {
          "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a senior business analyst."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ $json.prompt }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-code-format-message",
      "name": "Code \u2014 Format Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1350, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extract the AI response from OpenAI\nconst response = $json;\nconst brief = response.choices[0].message.content;\n\nconst today = new Date().toLocaleDateString('es-AR', { \n  weekday: 'long', year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' \n});\n\nconst message = `\ud83d\udcca *Brief Ejecutivo \u2014 NovaTrend*\n\ud83d\udcc5 ${today}\n\n${brief}\n\n_Generado automaticamente por n8n + OpenAI_`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { message } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-telegram-send",
      "name": "Telegram \u2014 Send Brief",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1600, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.telegram.org/botYOUR_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN/sendMessage",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "body": {
          "chat_id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
          "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
